<title>USA: Texas buyout group to buy  Del Monte Foods - paper.</title>
<headline>Texas buyout group to buy  Del Monte Foods - paper.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texas Pacific Group, a buyout firm in Fort Worth, Texas, has agreed to acquire Del Monte Foods, the Wall Street Journal said in its electronic edition Friday.</p>
<p>The report, citing people familiar with the situation, said the deal is expected to be worth at least $800 million, including the assumption of debt.</p>
<p>It said the acquisition for closely-held Del Monte, whose owners include Merrill Lynch, Citicorp's venture capital unit and Kikkoman Corp, could be announced today.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
